'''Anti-Baliscan sentiment''' ('''Baliscaphobia''' or '''Baliscanophobia''') is an extreme or irrational fear or contempt of [[Balisca]], the [[Baliscan people]], or the [[Confederal government of Balisca|Baliscan government]]. It has existed in various forms and in different countries for centuries. Its antonym is [[Baliscanophilia]].

